  "description": "MiniMax M2.7 \u2014 language model served by Fireworks AI via the UnitySVC gateway.\n\nMixture-of-Experts language model. M2.7 is capable of building complex agent harnesses and completing highly elaborate productivity tasks, leveraging Agent Teams, complex Skills, and dynamic tool search. It is served over an OpenAI-compatible API with a 196608-token context window; requests are proxied through the UnitySVC gateway and metered per token.\n\nReach it through the UnitySVC gateway either on the managed channel (the platform supplies the Fireworks AI key and resells tokens at the listed rate \u2014 nothing to configure) or the byok channel (bring your own Fireworks AI key and route free). The endpoint accepts both OpenAI Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages requests \u2014 the gateway auto-detects the dialect, translates to the upstream, and returns the response in the format you sent. See the code examples for both styles.",
